docs {
	GIVEN the managing director (DAGL) of the accounting firm ULASTELIG RETTFERDIG TIGER AS
		AND the accounting firm holds the accountant (REGN) role for HUMAN TOPP KATT BIL (ENK)
	WHEN the DAGL is authorized for the accountant resource on behalf of the ENK
	THEN no access-restriction permits through keyrole inheritance,
		while ClientDelegation via the accounting firm does not (only client delegations count)
}
